    "body": "<h2>你想从哪里开始？</h2><div class=\"feature-grid\">\n<a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/getting-started\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🚀</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">初次使用 Kaderblick</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">设置账户、登录、首次关联、导航和个人资料。</div></a>\n<a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/roles\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🧭</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">按角色查看帮助</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">查找适合球员、家长、教练、工作人员、职务人员、管理员和 Supporter 的说明。</div></a>\n<a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/games\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⚽</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">比赛业务与比赛日</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">赛程、参与、比赛计划、事件、live ticker、视频、锦标赛和分析。</div></a>\n<a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/calendar\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📅</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">日程与参与</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">日历视图、日程类型、回复、提醒和重复日程。</div></a>\n<a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/clubs-teams\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">👥</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">球队与俱乐部</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">名单、球员、教练、赛季、训练证明、分配和职责。</div></a>\n<a class=\"feature-card\" href=\"/zh-hans/admin\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🛡️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">管理、财务与装备</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">用户关联、俱乐部和球队、账目、个人欠款、处罚与器材。</div></a></div>\n<h2>各区域如何关联</h2><p>Kaderblick 不会为每个区域重复录入信息。球队会连接球员、教练、日程、比赛和任务；比赛还可连接参与、阵容、比赛计划、事件、live ticker、视频和分析。因此，一项修改可能在多个位置显示。</p>\n<div class=\"feature-grid\"><div class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">1</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">俱乐部和球队提供上下文</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">关联和职责分配决定哪些人员、日程和内容与账户相关。</div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">2</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">日程组织工作</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">训练、比赛和任务连接时间、地点、参与者、回复和提醒。</div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">3</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">比赛连接准备与分析</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">提前准备名单和比赛计划，再由事件、视频和分析补充比赛过程。</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"callout callout--info\">\n    <div class=\"callout__icon\">ℹ️</div>\n    <div class=\"callout__body\">\n                    <div class=\"callout__title\">你的界面可能不同</div>\n                <div class=\"callout__text\">可见菜单和操作取决于角色、分配以及当前打开的俱乐部、球队或记录。找不到所述功能时，请使用“按角色查看帮助”。</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<h2>全部帮助区域</h2><div class=\"feature-grid\"><a href=\"/zh-hans/getting-started\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🚀</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">入门指南</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">从首次访问到可使用的个人工作界面。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/roles\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🧭</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">按角色查看帮助</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">按角色和职责查找路径与差异。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/authentication\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🔐</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">登录与注册</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">登录、注册、确认、恢复和解锁。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/clubs-teams\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🏢</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">俱乐部与球队</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">俱乐部、赛季、球队、工作人员、职务人员和分配。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/venues\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📍</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">比赛场地</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/training-proofs\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🏃</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">训练证明</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/clothing-sizes\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">👕</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">服装尺码</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/players\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⚽</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">球员</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">球员资料、名单、缺席、文档和关联。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/coaches\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🧑‍🏫</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">教练</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">教练资料、球队、许可证和职能。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/watchlist\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🔖</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">关注列表</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/games\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🏟️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">比赛</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">赛程、详情、比赛日、live ticker、导入和锦标赛。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/quick-events\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⚡</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">快速事件</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/football-de-import\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📥</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">fussball.de 导入</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/my-matchday\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⚽</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">我的比赛日</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/help-out\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🤝</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">临时支援</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/calendar\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📅</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">日历与活动</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">新建、查看、回复日程并设置提醒。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/lineups\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📋</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">阵型</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">模板、阵容、比赛计划和战术阶段。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/tournaments\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🏆</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">锦标赛</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">锦标赛资料、赛程、对阵和结果。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/video-analysis\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🎬</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">视频与分析</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">比赛视频、事件、片段和分析。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/messages\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">💬</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">消息</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">站内消息和会话。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/news\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📰</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">新闻</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">阅读和管理俱乐部及球队动态。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/tasks\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">✅</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">任务</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">管理自己的、创建的和共享的任务。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/surveys\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📊</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">调查</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">回答、新建和分析问卷。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/notifications\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🔔</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">通知</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">阅读通知并管理发送渠道。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/knowledge-pool\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📚</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">知识库</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/feedback\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">💡</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">反馈与帮助</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/dashboard\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🖥️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">仪表板</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">小组件和个人每日总览。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/reports\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📈</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">分析报告</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">分析模板、筛选、图表和结果。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/car-pools\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🚗</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">拼车</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">围绕日程组织行程和空余座位。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/my-balance\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🍹</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">我的账单</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/cash-book\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">💶</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">现金账簿</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/billing\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">💳</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">账单与订阅</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/inventory\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📦</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">库存</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/profile\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">👤</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">我的资料</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">个人资料、安全、语言和设置。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/admin\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⚙️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">管理</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">管理、用户、财务、器材和平台区域。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/user-assignments\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">👥</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">用户与关联</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/staff-assignments\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🪪</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">工作人员与职务</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/xp-system\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⭐</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">XP 系统</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">经验值、等级、称号和 Hall of Fame。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/fines-catalogue\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">⚖️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">奖惩目录</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">此区域的详细分步说明。</div></a></div>\n<h2>摄像系统与配套软件</h2><p>已有的摄像系统、组装、软件和配套工具说明保留在独立区域。</p><div class=\"feature-grid\"><a href=\"/zh-hans/tools/camera-systems\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">📷</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">摄像机系统</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">原有摄像系统总览及其全部子页面。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/tools/video-manager\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">🎞️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">VideoManager</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">管理、检查和准备 Kaderblick 录像。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/tools/analysis-player\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">▶️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">分析播放器</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">播放录像并处理分析标记。</div></a><a href=\"/zh-hans/tools/video-combiner\" class=\"feature-card\"><div class=\"feature-card__icon\">✂️</div><div class=\"feature-card__title\">Video Combiner</div><div class=\"feature-card__desc\">将多个 Kaderblick 视频文件合并为一段录像。</div></a></div>\n<h2>获得支持</h2><ol><li>打开相关区域说明，检查当前操作的前置条件。</li><li>在<a href=\"/zh-hans/roles\">按角色查看帮助</a>中核对角色和分配。</li><li>使用 Kaderblick 中的<strong>我的反馈</strong>，清楚说明可复现问题或改进建议。</li><li>缺少关联或权限时，联系球队或俱乐部管理员。</li></ol>"
}
